--TEST--
an enum's own declaration highlights the read of one of its cases, because that read was recorded against the enum — the case beside it pinning that the enum is what the highlight is keyed on, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Sta<|>tus: int
{
    case Draft = 1;
    case Live = 2;
}

var $s = Status::Draft;
--REQUEST--
documentHighlight
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:8:10
